{
  "info": {
    "name": "Checkout Quest",
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "description": "Full API test suite for the checkout-quest modular monolith.\n\nHappy-path flow (run in order):\n1. Create Cart\n2. Add Item (x2)\n3. Get Cart\n4. Checkout Cart  →  sets orderId\n5. Get Order\n6. Initiate Payment  →  sets paymentId + providerRef\n7. Get Payment\n8. Simulate Confirm (mock provider)\n9. Get Payment (expect CONFIRMED)\n10. Get Order (expect PAID)\n11. Ledger checks\n\nCollection variables (auto-populated by test scripts):\n- baseUrl   : http://localhost:8080\n- mockUrl   : http://localhost:8081\n- cartId\n- orderId\n- paymentId\n- providerRef",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl",    "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "mockUrl",    "value": "http://localhost:8081"  },
    { "key": "cartId",     "value": "" },
    { "key": "orderId",    "value": "" },
    { "key": "paymentId",  "value": "" },
    { "key": "providerRef","value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Cart",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Create Cart",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('cartId present', () => pm.expect(body.cartId).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('cartId', body.cartId);",
                  "console.log('cartId =', body.cartId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/carts",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["carts"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2a. Add Item — Laptop",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('status is OPEN', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('OPEN'));",
                  "pm.test('items has 1 entry', () => pm.expect(body.items.length).to.eql(1));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"prod-laptop-001\",\n  \"quantity\": 1,\n  \"unitPrice\": 1299.99,\n  \"currency\": \"USD\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/carts/{{cartId}}/items",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["carts", "{{cartId}}", "items"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2b. Add Item — Mouse",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('items has 2 entries', () => pm.expect(body.items.length).to.eql(2));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": \"prod-mouse-007\",\n  \"quantity\": 2,\n  \"unitPrice\": 49.99,\n  \"currency\": \"USD\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/carts/{{cartId}}/items",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["carts", "{{cartId}}", "items"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Get Cart",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('status is OPEN', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('OPEN'));",
                  "pm.test('2 items', () => pm.expect(body.items.length).to.eql(2));",
                  "pm.test('totalAmount correct', () => {",
                  "  // 1*1299.99 + 2*49.99 = 1399.97",
                  "  pm.expect(Number(body.totalAmount)).to.be.closeTo(1399.97, 0.01);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/carts/{{cartId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["carts", "{{cartId}}"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
